{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "chat-layout",
  "title": "Chat layout",
  "group": "Chat",
  "order": 1,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The conversation column: messages stacked 20 px apart in `.chat`, the history scrolling above a composer that never scrolls away, and a Latest button that appears only when the reader has scrolled up. Newest at the bottom, always.",
    "id": "Kolom percakapan: pesan bertumpuk dengan jarak 20 px di `.chat`, riwayat bergulir di atas composer yang tidak ikut tergulir, dan tombol Terbaru yang muncul hanya saat pembaca menggulir ke atas. Pesan terbaru selalu di bawah."
  },
  "titleId": "Chat layout",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A tutoring conversation",
        "desc": "Scroll the history up and the Latest button rises in; press it to glide back. Type a question and press Enter: your message joins the column.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"docs-scroll\" id=\"cl-scroll\" style=\"height: 320px;\">\n    <div class=\"chat\" id=\"cl-chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Conversation with your tutor\">\n      <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Today, 09:12</p>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Why was my answer to question 4 marked wrong?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:12</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Question 4 asks for the net force, not the applied force. You added the 20 N push but left out friction, which acts against it with 6 N. The net force is 14 N, so the acceleration is 14 N divided by 7 kg, which is 2 m/s².</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy answer\" data-lds-copy=\"The net force is 14 N, so the acceleration is 2 m/s².\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Try again\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share answer\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">So friction always points against the motion?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:14</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Against the motion, or against the direction it would move if nothing held it. A book resting on a tilted table has friction pointing up the slope even though it is not moving yet.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy answer\" data-lds-copy=\"Friction points against the motion or the motion it would have.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Try again\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share answer\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Can I try a similar question?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:15</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Here is one. A 5 kg crate is pushed with 30 N across a floor that resists with 10 N of friction. What is its acceleration?</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy answer\" data-lds-copy=\"A 5 kg crate is pushed with 30 N against 10 N of friction. What is its acceleration?\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Try again\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share answer\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"cl-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Latest</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); const t = this.querySelector('textarea').value.trim(); if (!t) return; const m = document.createElement('div'); m.className = 'msg msg--me is-new'; const b = document.createElement('div'); b.className = 'bubble'; b.textContent = t; m.append(b); const c = document.getElementById('cl-chat'); c.insertBefore(m, c.querySelector('.chat__jump')); const s = document.getElementById('cl-scroll'); s.scrollTo({ top: s.scrollHeight, behavior: 'smooth' });\"><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message your tutor\" placeholder=\"Ask about this lesson\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"chat-scroll\" id=\"chat-scroll\"><!-- your scroller: overflow-y: auto, flex: 1 -->\n  <div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Conversation with your tutor\">\n    <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Today, 09:12</p>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Why was my answer to question 4 marked wrong?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:12</span></div>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Question 4 asks for the net force…</div>\n      <div class=\"msg__actions\">…</div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"chat-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Latest</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message your tutor\" placeholder=\"Ask about this lesson\"></textarea>\n  <button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { init } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  init();\n  document.querySelector('.composer').addEventListener('lds:send', (e) => sendToTutor(e.detail.text));\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "System lines mark what changed",
        "desc": "Day breaks, a mode switching on, a file joining the conversation: centered footnote lines, no bubble, no actions. They are part of the history, so they scroll with it.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Exam practice\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Yesterday</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Quiz me on chapter 3, ten questions.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Ready when you are. Each question has four choices; answer with the letter.</div></div>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Exam mode is on. Hints stay hidden until you submit.</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">You attached lab-report-draft.pdf</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Today</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Submit my answers.</div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Before the first message",
        "desc": "An empty conversation says what the assistant can do and offers two or three starting questions as chips. A chip fills the composer; the person still presses send.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">school</span></div>\n    <p class=\"empty__title\">Ask about Biology 101</p>\n    <p class=\"empty__body\">Answers use your course notes and say which page they come from.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chip-row\" style=\"justify-content: center;\">\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Explain osmosis simply</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Quiz me on cell parts</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Summarize chapter 2</button>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Ask a question\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"empty\">\n  <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">school</span></div>\n  <p class=\"empty__title\">Ask about Biology 101</p>\n  <p class=\"empty__body\">Answers use your course notes and say which page they come from.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"chip-row\">\n  <button class=\"chip\">Explain osmosis simply</button>\n  <button class=\"chip\">Quiz me on cell parts</button>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>…</form>\n<!-- On a chip click: put its text in the textarea, dispatch 'input' (enables send), focus it. -->"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Percakapan bimbingan belajar",
        "desc": "Gulir riwayat ke atas dan tombol Terbaru muncul; tekan untuk meluncur kembali. Ketik pertanyaan lalu tekan Enter: pesan Anda masuk ke kolom.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"docs-scroll\" id=\"cl-scroll\" style=\"height: 320px;\">\n    <div class=\"chat\" id=\"cl-chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Percakapan dengan tutor Anda\">\n      <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Hari ini, 09.12</p>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Kenapa jawaban saya untuk soal nomor 4 disalahkan?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.12</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Soal nomor 4 menanyakan gaya total, bukan gaya dorong. Anda menghitung dorongan 20 N tetapi tidak memasukkan gesekan yang melawannya sebesar 6 N. Gaya totalnya 14 N, jadi percepatannya 14 N dibagi 7 kg, yaitu 2 m/s².</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin jawaban\" data-lds-copy=\"Gaya totalnya 14 N, jadi percepatannya 2 m/s².\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan jawaban\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Jadi gesekan selalu berlawanan dengan arah gerak?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.14</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Berlawanan dengan arah gerak, atau dengan arah benda akan bergerak jika tidak ada yang menahan. Buku yang diam di atas meja miring mendapat gesekan ke arah atas lereng walaupun belum bergerak.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin jawaban\" data-lds-copy=\"Gesekan berlawanan dengan arah gerak atau arah gerak yang akan terjadi.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan jawaban\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Boleh saya coba soal yang mirip?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.15</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Ini soalnya. Peti 5 kg didorong dengan gaya 30 N di lantai yang memberi gesekan 10 N. Berapa percepatannya?</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin jawaban\" data-lds-copy=\"Peti 5 kg didorong 30 N melawan gesekan 10 N. Berapa percepatannya?\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan jawaban\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"cl-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Terbaru</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); const t = this.querySelector('textarea').value.trim(); if (!t) return; const m = document.createElement('div'); m.className = 'msg msg--me is-new'; const b = document.createElement('div'); b.className = 'bubble'; b.textContent = t; m.append(b); const c = document.getElementById('cl-chat'); c.insertBefore(m, c.querySelector('.chat__jump')); const s = document.getElementById('cl-scroll'); s.scrollTo({ top: s.scrollHeight, behavior: 'smooth' });\"><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Kirim pesan ke tutor\" placeholder=\"Tanyakan tentang materi ini\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"chat-scroll\" id=\"chat-scroll\"><!-- your scroller: overflow-y: auto, flex: 1 -->\n  <div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Percakapan dengan tutor Anda\">\n    <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Hari ini, 09.12</p>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Kenapa jawaban saya untuk soal nomor 4 disalahkan?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.12</span></div>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Soal nomor 4 menanyakan gaya total…</div>\n      <div class=\"msg__actions\">…</div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"chat-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Terbaru</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Kirim pesan ke tutor\" placeholder=\"Tanyakan tentang materi ini\"></textarea>\n  <button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { init } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  init();\n  document.querySelector('.composer').addEventListener('lds:send', (e) => sendToTutor(e.detail.text));\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Baris sistem menandai perubahan",
        "desc": "Pergantian hari, mode yang dinyalakan, berkas yang ditambahkan ke percakapan: baris footnote di tengah, tanpa bubble, tanpa aksi. Baris ini bagian dari riwayat, jadi ikut tergulir.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Latihan ujian\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Kemarin</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Uji saya tentang bab 3, sepuluh soal.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Silakan mulai kapan saja. Setiap soal punya empat pilihan; jawab dengan hurufnya.</div></div>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Mode ujian aktif. Petunjuk disembunyikan sampai Anda mengumpulkan jawaban.</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Anda melampirkan draf-laporan-praktikum.pdf</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Hari ini</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Kumpulkan jawaban saya.</div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sebelum pesan pertama",
        "desc": "Percakapan kosong menjelaskan apa yang bisa dilakukan asisten dan menawarkan dua atau tiga pertanyaan pembuka sebagai chip. Chip mengisi composer; orang tetap menekan kirim.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">school</span></div>\n    <p class=\"empty__title\">Tanya tentang Biologi kelas X</p>\n    <p class=\"empty__body\">Jawaban memakai catatan pelajaran Anda dan menyebut halaman sumbernya.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chip-row\" style=\"justify-content: center;\">\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Jelaskan osmosis dengan sederhana</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Uji saya tentang bagian sel</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Ringkas bab 2</button>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pesan\" placeholder=\"Ajukan pertanyaan\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"empty\">\n  <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">school</span></div>\n  <p class=\"empty__title\">Tanya tentang Biologi kelas X</p>\n  <p class=\"empty__body\">Jawaban memakai catatan pelajaran Anda dan menyebut halaman sumbernya.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"chip-row\">\n  <button class=\"chip\">Jelaskan osmosis dengan sederhana</button>\n  <button class=\"chip\">Uji saya tentang bagian sel</button>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>…</form>\n<!-- On a chip click: put its text in the textarea, dispatch 'input' (enables send), focus it. -->"
      }
    ]
  },
